# p5 mcp discover: a stdio server that answers `server/discover` with a reply that is not
# valid JSON-RPC, its result a string of terminal escapes (p5-mcp-discover-stdio.ts
# `malformed`), then speaks 2025-06-18. fx v0.0.16 fails the probe with that reply
# (`onRefusedLine`, src/mcp/server.zig:769-790@481104fd), reads the failure as a legacy
# answer, and initializes. Nothing the server wrote reaches the screen. `home wire` is
# what the server was sent.
fx: homefile .fx/mcp.json p5-mcp-discover-stdio-malformed-profile.json
xfx: homefile .xfx/mcp.json p5-mcp-discover-stdio-malformed-profile.json
gateway p5-mcp-hello.json
wait 6
type /mcp show fixture
key Enter
wait 3
snap show
home wire
